  "video_link": "",
  "rating": "5",
  "item_short_desc": "<p>Gear up with Rothco's Bonded Leather Garrison Belt, a timeless accessory designed for durability and style. Crafted from genuine leather, this belt boasts a square ring closure and 5 sizing holes on one end, ensuring a secure and adjustable fit. 2 snaps on the opposite end allow for easy alteration of the buckle and placement of the belt keeper. Ideal for law enforcement officials, this uniform belt seamlessly transitions from on-duty to off-duty wear.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "5545",
  "description": "<p>Gear up with Rothco's Bonded Leather Garrison Belt, a timeless accessory designed for durability and style. Crafted from genuine leather, this belt boasts a square ring closure and 5 sizing holes on one end, ensuring a secure and adjustable fit. 2 snaps on the opposite end allow for easy alteration of the buckle and placement of the belt keeper. Ideal for law enforcement officials, this uniform belt seamlessly transitions from on-duty to off-duty wear, complementing both uniform pants and jeans with equal aplomb. Available in a variety of widths, waist sizes, and buckle colors, this belt offers customization options to suit individual preferences. Whether you're on patrol or enjoying downtime, the Rothco Bonded Leather Garrison Belt is a versatile and reliable accessory that completes your look with finesse.</p>",
